"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nMathematics and neuroscience were brought in as the central subjects of the work.  \nCombining scientific knowledge with the mystery genre seems to be the biggest feature that defines his world of work.  \n\nIt distracts the reader's attention by presenting the classic mystery cliché of inheritance.  \nReaders familiar with the mystery genre naturally focus on .  \nHowever, the motive was pure yet fanatical intellectual greed.  \n\nThe author's deep interest in neuroscience and bioethics is evident.  "